{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/c869b7f1851cae2d09b5d27f4d229257.poster.avif?t=1757497574\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/c869b7f1851cae2d09b5d27f4d229257.webm?t=1757497574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/c869b7f1851cae2d09b5d27f4d229257.mp4?t=1757497574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fast lane with <i>Race Max Pro</i>, the ultimate  racing experience that lets you take control of the streets, the track, and the underground racing scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From lightning-fast sprints to technical drift battles and raw drag races, choose your path and master the art of racing across multiple disciplines. With dozens of officially licensed cars from top manufacturers, build your dream garage and personalize every ride with deep visual and performance customization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/ffa46216353301f2759eb1b6fcca92c4.avif?t=1757497574\" width=780 height=100 /></span><strong>Your Race, Your Rules:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street, Drift, Drag</strong> \u2013 Dominate three distinct racing styles, each with its own strategy, tracks, and challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Tuning System</strong> \u2013 Upgrade engine, turbo, gearbox, nitro, tires, and more. Fine-tune your cars to perfection based on race type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Customization</strong> \u2013 Change paint, wraps, rims, spoilers, and more to make your car truly yours.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/0bab197ae665d589d4417c95284d016f.poster.avif?t=1757497574\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/0bab197ae665d589d4417c95284d016f.webm?t=1757497574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/0bab197ae665d589d4417c95284d016f.mp4?t=1757497574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Climb the Ranks or Rule the Streets:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer League Mode</strong> \u2013 Compete in intense online leagues, climb ranks, and earn rewards as you rise to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Friends Mode</strong> \u2013 Race head-to-head with friends or rivals in custom matchups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Career</strong> \u2013 Rise from a street rookie to a motorsport legend through dozens of races.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/c4ec350722fbe5b9c4fa40d52aa6f887.poster.avif?t=1757497574\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/c4ec350722fbe5b9c4fa40d52aa6f887.webm?t=1757497574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/c4ec350722fbe5b9c4fa40d52aa6f887.mp4?t=1757497574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Events and Progression That Never Stop:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasons\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Unlock limited-edition rewards and exclusive cars by completing themed objectives each season.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Limited Events</strong> \u2013 Jump into fast-paced events with rotating rulesets and big rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing leaderboard glory or just want to burn rubber in a fully tuned JDM beast, <i>Race Max Pro</i> offers a complete racing experience tailored to your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build. Tune. Race. Repeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/4d1c2488de328085b77e3ed5ab832a91.poster.avif?t=1757497574\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/4d1c2488de328085b77e3ed5ab832a91.webm?t=1757497574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/4d1c2488de328085b77e3ed5ab832a91.mp4?t=1757497574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street, Drift, Drag\u00a0 race types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ real licensed cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer &amp; Ranked League</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full customization &amp; tuning system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-limited events and Seasons</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3042650?t=1757497574","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/3cd31811c5810126e15bf4fe9cd3e1130e54aa12/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757497574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset